5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of reinventing the wheel. Let’s check the history before we cheer.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. We need to know who is actually working before we promise more.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I worry we fix the loud complaints, not the slow parts. Let’s look at data.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’d like to see the old records. They often tell the quiet truth.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer looking at the long-term costs. Headlines hide the real burden.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, do you think the crew is stretched thin? I suspect the roster is a mess.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, likely. If we don’t check the books, we’re just guessing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, the old accessibility work might show where we failed passengers before.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, yes. The ground hides things. I want to see the completion records.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the ledger. I need to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’m going to dig into the pilots from eight years ago. They always fail quietly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll check the roster books. I need to see who is left with nothing.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll look at the journey audits. I want to see where the minutes go.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’ll look at the joint operators' minutes. I need to know who else says yes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll look at the capital ledger. I need to see the future debt.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let’s see what the dust says. I’ll be back with the ghosts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll find the empty chairs. The silence in the roster is loud.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I’ll trace the time. I want to know where the hours vanish.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll read the signatures. I want to know who is holding the pen.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll count the coins. I want to know what we owe tomorrow.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
