35,2,1,talk,May,,The pilots worked. The accessibility work was half done. We keep forgetting the half.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The late-turn pool is empty. We are running on overtime and luck.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The audits show waiting is the thief. The crowds are not the problem, the gaps are.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The minutes show the ferry and rail never agreed on data. The ground is not the only thing hiding.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The ledger shows we are borrowing from next year to pay for this one.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, if the pool is empty, we need to fix the roster, not the tracks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, exactly. We can’t promise more service if the people to run it are gone.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, if the data is split, we are flying blind. We need one clock.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, yes. The signatures are missing. We need to know who is responsible for the silence.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, the money is gone. We can’t buy new trains if we are paying for old debts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"I think we should focus on the roster. If the people are there, the service is there.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree. The roster is the foundation. Without it, the rest is just noise.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we should focus on the journey audits. If we fix the waiting, we fix the trip.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"I think we should focus on the joint operators. If we fix the agreement, we fix the data.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I think we should focus on the capital ledger. If we fix the debt, we fix the future.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,Let’s vote for the roster. It’s the only thing that’s actually broken.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll vote for the roster. It’s the only thing that’s actually empty.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,I’ll vote for the journey audits. It’s the only thing that’s actually slow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll vote for the joint operators. It’s the only thing that’s actually silent.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll vote for the capital ledger. It’s the only thing that’s actually heavy.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
